<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρον-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>concerning time, temporal,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοπικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.7.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ποίησις</span> creation <i>in
				time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				4.146b
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				145d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Prisc.Lyd.
				36.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				404
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chronological,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανόνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλία</span>) <i>annals</i> or
				<i>chronology,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Them.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ χρονικαί</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραφαί</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. σύνταξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.103
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Gramm.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἐπιρρήματα</span> adverbs <i>of
				time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				15.24
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				221i5
			</span></i>; <i>temporal,</i> i.e. quantitative, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράγγελμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					58.22
				</span></i>
			; of the <i>temporal</i> augment, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. αὐξήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					72.45
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>in respect of time,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					209.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
